WEBVTT

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.640
They look pretty strong.
Well done, Dr. Kori.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:02.890
Do you have enough money? You can use
it like bathwater, I don't mind.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.270
Thank you so much, Baron.

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.610
It's not "bathwater,"
it's "hot water."

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:11.190
He may have enough money, but his
brain is still coming up short.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.490
Now I'll be able to
get Satan back good!

00:01:55.360 --> 00:02:00.070
<i>The craziness surges toward us.</i>

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:05.750
<i>This is no time for tears.</i>

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:11.290
<i>I will raise my anticipations</i>
a <i>hundred-fold,</i>

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:16.550
and become our
party's leading man.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:24.140
<i>That which you can
lose yourself in</i>

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:29.600
<i>will someday make you
an incredible guy.</i>

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:32.270
<i>NO... TEN P-KAN.</i>

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.280
<i>The sky is clear.</i>

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.150
<i>IPPAI OPPAI</i>

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:40.610
<i>I am feeling fine.</i>

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.620
<i>The trouble is here, so enjoy,</i>

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.620
<i>you naughty little boy,</i>

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:49.290
<i>We Gotta Power!</i>

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:53.840
Dragonball <i>Z.</i>

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.010
<i>NO... TEN P-KAN.</i>

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:00.630
<i>My head is clear,</i>

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.600
<i>RA-MEN ROPPAI.</i>

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.140
<i>Mother doesn't care.</i>

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.270
<i>It's the century's end,
so twist and twirl,</i>

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:12.150
<i>you mischievous little girl,</i>

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.940
<i>We Gotta Power!</i>

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:21.160
Dragonball <i>Z.</i>

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:44.930
I hope No. 18 isn't doing
anything too rough.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:49.430
Kuririn-san, once No. 18-san
gets the money from Satan-san,

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.310
you're going to treat us to
whatever we want to eat, right?

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.310
Yeah. You can eat until
your sides split.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.900
You just let me take
care of it all.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:03.570
If you're lying, I'm going to
pull your hair out, Kuririn-san.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.950
D- d-don't be ridiculous!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.740
It took some time to get
it to grow out this far!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:14.380
Papa... Vroom-vroom!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.690
H- hold up!

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:48.240
W- what's this?

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:55.460
Hey, mister, enough
of this already.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.960
The 20 million zeni you promised
me at theTenkaichi Tournament

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.880
for letting you win...

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:06.090
I'm telling you to hurry
up and pay me in full.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:11.810
Y- you see, I haven't yet
gotten the prize money...

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:15.190
It looks to me like
you want to get hurt.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.780
L- I'll pay you! If you could
just wait a little while...

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.320
Just a minute!

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:27.320
Did you make an appointment
with my secretary?

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.370
If you want an autograph,
I'll do that later.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.410
Right now, I'm in the
middle of something.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:35.620
I brought you a challenge
from my cousin.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:45.250
A challenge? Give that to my secretary.
I get hundreds of those every day.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.470
For someone who wet the bed
until he was in the 6th grade,

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.430
you've got a lot of
nerve, don't you?

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:54.430
Wet the bedl? Who
told you thatl?

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.560
My cousin.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:59.520
The only one who knows about that is...
don't tell me it's Jaga!

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:04.110
That's right, Jaga Butta. You
can't say you don't know him.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:07.110
He knows everything about you.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.780
Yeah, we were
friends growing up.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:11.950
We both devoted ourselves to training
in order to become martial artists.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:14.040
You were rivals, weren't you?

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:18.960
Yeah. But compared to the ultra-prodigy
that I was, you have to feel bad for Jaga.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:22.920
Eventually, in the 6th
grade, he was beaten by me,

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.460
and he gave up his dreams of
becoming a martial artist.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.930
I always end up
having to do this.

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.600
I don't have time to
fight Jaga right now.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:36.810
I'm busy here. Go on. Off
with you, off with you.

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:41.440
Jaga wanted me to
tell you something.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.020
If it looks like he's going
to turn you down, he said,

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:47.110
then I will take your
world champion belt,

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.790
and on top of that, what happened
when you were in 6th grade will-

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:53.450
Shut up! It was only that one time
when I stayed the night that summer!

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:56.120
One time, two times,
it's all the same.

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.460
Hey! I was here first,
you disrespectful lout!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.460
Take care of this after
I'm finished with him.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.510
If you say no, then I'll
go to the press with how,

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:08.130
until you were in the 6th grade-

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:11.090
All right! I just have
to fight Jaga, right?

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.760
No, you'll fight the Biowarriors
that Jaga has developed.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.640
Biowarriorsl?

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:22.150
Hey, Trunks, switch places.
Let me see, too!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:24.860
D- don't tell me
that among them,

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:28.440
there's anyone whose hair turns golden
and stands up on end, is there?

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:29.950
Whoever heard of
anyone like that?

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.990
Okay then. I'm going to
go beat someone easily,

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.450
and then be right back, so
just wait a minute for me.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:38.290
I'm not falling for that.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:42.500
You're planning on running away from
me, right? You put on a poor act.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.960
I'm going with you!

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:51.130
And that's what's going on. You
can head on back to Kame House.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.090
I'll come with you.

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:55.760
You have to look after
our girl, here.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.100
But, No. 18...

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:02.100
You're not going to
do what I ask you?

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.980
Okay, then. I'll stay home.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:14.070
Be careful! Come home soon!

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:29.380
Oh, those guys... Damn, it's
nice to be single, huh?

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.970
Papa, 90 Potty!

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:38.350
D- don't go yet! Hold on! Hold on!
Hold on! Bathroom! Bathroom!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.930
Aah, and out it comes...

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:16.490
<i>There doesn't seem to be
anyone too great here.</i>

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:21.240
Lam the world champion,
the famous Mister Satan!

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:26.120
<i>Nice one! Though the sun
is awfully bright...</i>

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:28.670
It's been a long
time, huh Satan?

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:37.300
Welcome to May Queen Castle.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:41.680
Menmen, nice work.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.930
Baron Jaga Butta!

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.700
Y- you're him? You're not at
all the way I remember you.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:01.570
Apparently, you've succeeded
your pop and become a baron,

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.120
but what is the deal with that
pudgy little body of yours?

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.250
Training! Do some training!

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:08.710
Who is this young miss, here?

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:12.790
She's my number one pupil.

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.050
Number one pupil, am I?

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.350
Cut that out, Goten!
It tickles, you know!

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:40.110
G- Goten, I'm no good
around these things!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:43.240
You're a cutie, aren't you?

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:46.950
There, there, there. Go
off someplace else, okay?

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.960
Being raised on Mount Paozu,
I guess he's used to this.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:56.710
If you hadn't been around, I would
have been the world champion!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:57.880
That's right.

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:03.550
Jaga has lived his life up to today
with the intent of making you pay.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.100
Are you going to
apologize to him?

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:07.760
You're as obsessed as ever.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.560
When you lost to me as a child,

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.940
you would follow me all the way into
the bathroom, crying the whole time.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:16.860
Ha! That's all in the past! With
all of this surplus money I have,

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:19.780
I've employed the finest
biotechnology experts out there,

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.360
and had them create
these Biowarriors!

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:23.930
You're going to fight
these warriors,

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:26.450
who I am so proud of,
in my Battle Stage!

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:30.120
This will be a waste
of your efforts.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.460
Goten, this is starting
to get exciting, huh?

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:33.460
Mm-hmm.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.790
Trunks-kun, what's a Biowarrior?

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.800
It's a warrior that was created
with biotechnology, right?

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:43.430
What's biotechnology?

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:47.930
You don't know anything, huh?
It's genetic engineering.

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:52.100
They can even make new creatures
out of existing cells.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.940
Trunks-kun, you're amazing!

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.190
Both Mama and Grandpa are
scientists, after all,

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.860
so this sort of thing is
common knowledge to me.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:07.450
So then, what's
genetic engineering?

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:12.960
Well?

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.620
Genetic engineering is...

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:23.130
How silly! It's obviously
biotechnology, you know?

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.130
Ah, so that's it.

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:28.510
All right!

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.990
Ee-yow!

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.390
Satan, this is the Battle Stage!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.560
Why aren't there any spectators?

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:15.100
There aren't any TV cameras
here either, are there?

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:19.480
It's rude to treat me, the world
champion, in this way, isn't it?

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:23.440
You big show-off. Menmen?

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.110
<i>Yes'?</i>

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.860
<i>Here's a camera for you.</i>

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:41.130
Awesome! I'd like to fight
in a place like this!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.210
He's rich, after all.

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.300
Huh?

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.220
Trunks-kun, that man...

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:53.060
Behind that Baron
whatever-his-name-is...

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.520
It's the prayergiver from when
we were in Natade Village!

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:06.030
What's he doing here?

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:10.700
Well, let's hurry and get this started.
I'm busy.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:36.890
N- No. 18! How would you like
to go at them for a bit?

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:42.100
If you'll add on another
20 million zeni.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:44.110
R- right.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:50.700
Okay, who's first? My number one pupil, No.
18, will face you.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:53.780
Not so fast! I will
decide the match-ups!

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:08.420
I want to go back
with Satan, quickly!

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:12.090
Let's not make things too difficult,
and settle this in a Battle Royale!

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:15.140
I'll defeat the whole lot
of you in place of Satan!

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:22.100
No way! That goes against
the spirit of fair spray!

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:24.940
You dummy. What you meant
to say was "fair play."

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.900
We're going to join in, too!

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:37.780
Is that...?

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:39.240
What is this?

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:44.460
Old man Onjichama-onbachama,
long time no see.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.000
You know them?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.670
Y- yes.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:52.760
Fellas, this is not the Junior
Round of the Tenkaichi Tournament.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:55.090
You have to be 18 years
old to enter here.

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:59.810
Right, right. These Biowarriors
are too strong for you.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:04.190
I wish you would give us some credit.
We can do this sort of thing.

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.950
These kids are your
pupils too, aren't they?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:22.790
They're using cheap tricks!
You can't fool my eyes!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:23.960
All right, fine!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:27.460
Biowarriors, turn this place into
a villagefest with those guys!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.460
Villagefest?

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:31.670
What you meant to
say is "bloodfest."

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:33.300
They're both festivals!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:44.430
Yow-ow-ow! That's
fighting dirty!

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:47.100
What sort of folks are these?

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:50.110
<i>This is bad! I wonder
if they realize...</i>

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:05.830
Jaga, how do you like
my pupils' strength?

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:08.500
I didn't even have to join in.

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.800
This is getting worse and worse.
Now, while I still have a chance...

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:17.760
Prayergiver, where are you going? Things
are just about to get interesting.

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.430
J- just heading to the bathroom.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:20.430
Hold it in.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:21.760
O- okay.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.600
All right! Now comes
the real thing!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:26.560
Satan, I still have a
trump card to play!

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.140
Don't be too stunned
when you see him!

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:30.110
If you're going to
apologize, now's the time!

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:33.570
Jaga, you sound like a beaten
dog, whining from a distance.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.110
No worries. Bring out
anyone you want.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:39.530
No matter who you bring out,
they won't be any match for us.

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:41.780
Right. Guys?

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:48.290
Ooh, geez, you're so smug! Damn it, f-fine!
<i>I'll</i> show you!

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:28.830
Satan-chan, it's the end
of the line for you!

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:39.420
Awesome!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:44.430
Say, miss, how do you
make Biowarriors?

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:47.430
That might be a little too hard
for you boys to understand.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:51.770
I know that biotechnology
is genetic engineering!

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:54.270
Oh my, that's amazing!

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.320
My mama is good when
it comes to mechanics.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.780
T- Trunks-kun...

00:19:58.860 --> 00:19:59.780
What is it?

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:03.450
T- that one has a tail!

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.410
Like a Saiyan, huh?

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.850
B- Broly!

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:42.150
B- but we completely wiped him out
that time with a Kamehame-Ha...

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.240
Uh-huh...

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:05.300
He's supposed to be dead!
That's not fair, huh?

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:06.720
Uh-uh...

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.270
Jaga, whoever you send out,
the result will be the same.

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:13.270
You're just wasting your money.

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:17.730
Shut up! Okay, Doctor,
send out the superwarrior!

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.440
Nain, remove the culture
fluid, would you?

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:23.030
Yes, Dr. Kori.

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:34.790
T- Trunks-kun...

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:37.830
I- I think I'm going
to wet myself again...

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:42.800
This time, I will clobber him.
No. 18, stay out of this.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.760
Hmph! Suit yourself.

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:49.510
Who's it going to be!?

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:53.770
Hey, Mister! You're the one
who brought Broly here, huh?

00:21:53.850 --> 00:22:00.440
Thanks to you, I lost all face as
the prayergiver of Natade Village.

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:04.570
Nobody asks me to do any
work for them any more!

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:06.780
Did Broly survive?

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:08.280
Broly died.

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:10.950
He was beaten so badly by you,
there wasn't any trace left.

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.540
What is in there is a Broly
that has been regenerated

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:15.500
through bio-power
from his genes!

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:35.560
I took some of the dried blood
that was inside the space pod,

00:22:35.640 --> 00:22:37.890
and sold it to the baron.

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:50.280
From there, the superb bioscientists
employed by the baron

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:52.780
took that single drop
of Broly's blood,

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:58.330
and did a magnificent job of bringing
the mightiest of warriors back to life.

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:04.380
That can't be!

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:08.880
Mister, if Broly comes back to life,
do you know what's going to happen?

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:12.890
Which is why I'm leaving
the rest up to you guys!

00:23:13.850 --> 00:23:16.060
What should we do, Trunks-kun?

00:23:24.860 --> 00:23:28.780
Hei! Can you tell how
incredible he is, too?

00:23:28.860 --> 00:23:32.450
Relax. The superwarrior
has been made

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:34.870
to respond to all orders
given in my voice.

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:36.540
He's on our side.

00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:39.370
Goten, if it's going
to come to that,

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:42.020
let's blow away the capsule that
Broly is in before he comes out!

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:43.500
Mm-hmm!

00:23:48.840 --> 00:23:50.430
Ka...

00:23:50.510 --> 00:23:52.510
me...

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:01.440
What about a kame ("turtle")?

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:03.770
L- I'll bet it's another trick!

00:24:03.860 --> 00:24:06.570
Those kids! What do they
think they're doingl?

00:24:08.190 --> 00:24:10.450
Ha...

00:24:10.530 --> 00:24:12.820
me...

00:24:50.530 --> 00:24:53.110
Nain, the culture fluid
is spilling out!

00:24:53.200 --> 00:24:56.120
Shift the protective
walls around number 13!

00:24:56.200 --> 00:24:57.200
Right!

00:25:38.740 --> 00:25:39.780
He's out!

00:25:39.870 --> 00:25:41.290
What do we do?

00:25:43.870 --> 00:25:47.080
Hei! Stop! He's on our side!

00:25:58.260 --> 00:25:59.720
<i>He“.!</i>

00:26:02.640 --> 00:26:05.350
W- w-what kind of
fluid is thatl?

00:26:05.440 --> 00:26:07.770
Nain! Dispose of that
culture fluid at once!

00:26:07.850 --> 00:26:09.930
When the culture fluid comes
in contact with the air,

00:26:10.020 --> 00:26:12.480
it devours the cells of any
genetically differing life form,

00:26:12.560 --> 00:26:15.780
and multiplies itself over and over,
until it is beyond our control!

00:26:15.860 --> 00:26:16.860
Right!

00:26:21.200 --> 00:26:25.790
Now, superwarrior,
show me your power!

00:26:25.870 --> 00:26:27.830
Defeat Satan!

00:26:30.880 --> 00:26:34.800
No. 18! You go first after all!

00:26:36.840 --> 00:26:39.300
All right. This will add on
another 2O million zeni.

00:26:39.390 --> 00:26:41.670
Once I defeat him, we're heading
back immediately, got it?

00:26:41.690 --> 00:26:42.760
Then you'll pay up!

00:26:42.850 --> 00:26:47.600
F- fine! If we get home safely,
I'll pay you as much as you want!

00:26:47.690 --> 00:26:50.100
Don't forget those words!

00:26:50.190 --> 00:26:51.810
No. 18-san!

00:27:14.460 --> 00:27:15.960
I can't believe
this thing exists.

00:27:16.050 --> 00:27:19.800
It's one unbelievable monster! 2O
million zeni is too inexpensive!

00:27:27.850 --> 00:27:30.250
Way to go! How do you like that?
Looks pretty painful, Satan!

00:27:30.270 --> 00:27:34.110
This is the real thing! You can apologize
now, but I still won't let you off!

00:27:34.190 --> 00:27:36.530
Now, for all the years' worth
of bitterness I've harbored,

00:27:36.610 --> 00:27:39.360
pound Satan to a pulp!

00:27:42.200 --> 00:27:44.780
L- I'll be killed!

00:27:45.870 --> 00:27:50.080
T- time out a second! My
stomach is starting to hurt!

00:28:06.850 --> 00:28:08.720
Save us!

00:28:15.520 --> 00:28:19.780
Pops, what are you so afraid ofl?
You're the world champion, right?

00:28:19.860 --> 00:28:21.780
You've got to fight back!

00:28:21.860 --> 00:28:25.120
R- right. But my
stomach hurts...

00:28:25.200 --> 00:28:26.870
Trunks-kun!

00:28:28.540 --> 00:28:31.120
Goten, we're not going
to be beaten this time!

00:28:31.210 --> 00:28:32.210
Uh-uh!

00:28:37.880 --> 00:28:40.760
Oh! Golden warriors!

00:28:43.180 --> 00:28:45.390
Now things are going to be fine!

00:28:46.180 --> 00:28:48.100
We're not about to
be beaten up twice!

00:28:48.180 --> 00:28:50.140
We won't fall for the
same trick again!

00:29:24.180 --> 00:29:30.100
Stop! If any more of that culture fluid
is spilled... if that were to happen!

00:29:30.180 --> 00:29:34.940
Hey, Broly! I can see through
all of your slow moves!

00:29:35.020 --> 00:29:39.150
How long did you think those same
energy blasts were going to work?

00:29:46.860 --> 00:29:49.780
Stop! That's enough! Stop!

00:29:55.540 --> 00:29:56.960
We can take him, Goten!

00:29:57.040 --> 00:29:59.460
I can see how he's
going to move next!

00:29:59.540 --> 00:30:01.420
I can see, too!

00:30:03.170 --> 00:30:04.880
Save us!

00:30:12.520 --> 00:30:14.100
We're falling! It's no use!

00:30:14.180 --> 00:30:15.100
Let us out of here, quick!

00:30:15.180 --> 00:30:16.560
The culture fluid is coming!

00:30:16.640 --> 00:30:19.270
All right, this is all of it.

00:30:28.200 --> 00:30:29.450
What's thisl?

00:30:29.530 --> 00:30:32.830
Onbachama jichama!
Yayakoni totsama!

00:30:40.880 --> 00:30:42.250
W- what is it?

00:30:43.550 --> 00:30:44.760
Push the emergency button!

00:30:44.840 --> 00:30:46.090
What's going onl?

00:30:46.170 --> 00:30:47.430
Open the door!

00:30:47.510 --> 00:30:50.430
Open up! Open up! Open up!

00:30:53.510 --> 00:30:54.510
We' re saved!

00:31:03.070 --> 00:31:04.980
Goten! Hit him from your side!

00:31:05.070 --> 00:31:05.480
What I?

00:31:05.530 --> 00:31:07.070
Save us!

00:31:15.540 --> 00:31:19.080
If I stay here, no matter how many
lives I have, it won't be enough!

00:31:34.180 --> 00:31:35.560
You bastard!

00:31:55.660 --> 00:31:58.870
Are you okay? I was
worried about you.

00:31:58.950 --> 00:32:03.000
A husband ought to at least
rescue his own wife, right?

00:32:23.190 --> 00:32:24.690
Kuririn-san!

00:32:41.210 --> 00:32:42.460
Goten, now!

00:32:42.540 --> 00:32:43.540
All right!

00:32:48.090 --> 00:32:49.420
Goten, we've got him!

00:32:49.510 --> 00:32:50.510
Uh-huh!

00:32:55.050 --> 00:32:57.510
Help me!

00:32:57.600 --> 00:32:58.600
Goten!

00:33:12.530 --> 00:33:16.490
Goten! What are you doingl?
I can't do this alone!

00:33:19.200 --> 00:33:20.540
My shoulder!

00:33:38.720 --> 00:33:42.430
Stop! That's far enough!
He's going to die!

00:33:42.520 --> 00:33:47.230
I'm the one who brought you back to life!
Listen to what I say!

00:33:56.660 --> 00:33:58.660
You'll pay for that!

00:34:11.210 --> 00:34:12.840
M- my shoulder!

00:34:19.850 --> 00:34:21.640
Rats!

00:34:23.520 --> 00:34:26.440
If only my shoulder wasn't hurt!

00:34:35.190 --> 00:34:36.820
Kienzanl!

00:34:57.930 --> 00:34:59.720
G- Goten!

00:35:03.180 --> 00:35:04.770
What should I do?

00:35:04.850 --> 00:35:07.100
Help us!

00:35:07.180 --> 00:35:09.730
Help us! Help us!

00:35:29.870 --> 00:35:31.580
T- that's it!

00:35:32.880 --> 00:35:34.170
That's got to be it!

00:35:43.180 --> 00:35:44.390
<i>BY!</i>

00:35:44.850 --> 00:35:48.230
Hey! I'll give you
a spanky-spanky!

00:35:49.850 --> 00:35:54.820
What's the matter, Broly? Get over
here, now, and I'll kill you!

00:35:56.610 --> 00:35:59.570
If you don't like it, come over
here and do something about it!

00:36:01.410 --> 00:36:02.410
Now!

00:36:03.530 --> 00:36:05.620
Take this, Broly!

00:37:14.850 --> 00:37:16.650
L- I did it!

00:37:59.610 --> 00:38:00.690
Goten!

00:38:08.160 --> 00:38:10.330
Goten! Goten!

00:38:32.010 --> 00:38:33.640
We made it!

00:38:38.850 --> 00:38:39.940
<i>Where's Brow'?</i>

00:38:40.020 --> 00:38:41.820
He's in that fluid.

00:38:44.400 --> 00:38:46.900
Instead of power, I
used up here, up here!

00:38:59.960 --> 00:39:03.090
I'm ruined! I've
lost everything!

00:39:03.170 --> 00:39:07.970
You idiot! You're going to lose your
life before you've lost everything else!

00:39:11.850 --> 00:39:14.140
Goten, we've got
to save everyone!

00:39:21.190 --> 00:39:24.440
Hold on tight! If you fall,
you'll be out for good!

00:39:24.530 --> 00:39:25.530
Right!

00:39:26.110 --> 00:39:27.950
Hurry up and go!

00:39:28.030 --> 00:39:30.360
D- don't push, No. 18!

00:39:34.540 --> 00:39:37.120
You old guys, hang onto me.

00:39:37.200 --> 00:39:40.120
You'd save me, even after
setting all of this up?

00:39:40.210 --> 00:39:44.630
Jaga, you've got to follow
his spirit of hair spray!

00:40:03.860 --> 00:40:06.440
It's no use. It has
no effect whatsoever.

00:40:06.530 --> 00:40:09.440
Isn't there anything we
can do about that fluid!?

00:40:09.530 --> 00:40:11.860
That culture fluid's replicative
power becomes stronger

00:40:11.950 --> 00:40:14.780
when it devours the cells
of a differing life form.

00:40:14.870 --> 00:40:17.160
Since it has taken in the
cells of that Broly monster,

00:40:17.240 --> 00:40:19.120
it has obtained
extraordinary power!

00:40:19.200 --> 00:40:21.620
At this rate, it will
cover the entire earth!

00:40:21.710 --> 00:40:24.460
It's the end of the world!

00:40:24.540 --> 00:40:26.630
I've done something terrible!

00:40:26.710 --> 00:40:27.870
Take a good look at yourself!

00:40:27.900 --> 00:40:30.420
Hey, you're in on
this too, Mister!

00:40:30.510 --> 00:40:31.430
You're right.

00:40:31.510 --> 00:40:33.300
Help me!

00:40:55.870 --> 00:40:59.410
Get away! I'm the world
champion, Mister Satan!

00:41:06.880 --> 00:41:09.920
I get it. The fluid is
vulnerable to the seawater.

00:41:10.010 --> 00:41:12.550
We can stop the fluid!

00:41:18.510 --> 00:41:20.100
Hurry!

00:41:20.180 --> 00:41:21.180
Let's go!

00:41:39.530 --> 00:41:42.620
Ka...

00:41:43.540 --> 00:41:45.790
me...

00:41:46.540 --> 00:41:48.590
ha...

00:41:49.500 --> 00:41:51.510
me...

00:41:51.840 --> 00:41:54.050
<i>HA!!</i>

00:42:51.860 --> 00:42:53.780
Goten, we did it!

00:42:53.860 --> 00:42:54.860
Uh-huh!

00:42:55.860 --> 00:42:58.860
Goten, way to figure that out!

00:42:58.950 --> 00:43:00.780
It was all thanks to Satan-san.

00:43:00.870 --> 00:43:04.700
Even he comes in handy
once in a while, huh?

00:43:06.750 --> 00:43:10.250
Kakarrot!

00:43:14.710 --> 00:43:16.590
What's with this guy!?

00:43:18.150 --> 00:43:19.150
We've had it now!

00:43:19.180 --> 00:43:20.760
We're done for!

00:43:26.850 --> 00:43:29.020
Look!

00:43:36.190 --> 00:43:39.110
You bastard! Startle
us, will you?

00:43:39.200 --> 00:43:41.360
That is one tenacious bastard.

00:43:49.210 --> 00:43:51.790
Now, Broly is finished for good!

00:43:51.880 --> 00:43:53.000
Uh-huh.

00:44:00.720 --> 00:44:03.090
Hey! Someone pick me up!

00:44:03.180 --> 00:44:06.010
All right. My pick-up
fare is 4O million zeni,

00:44:06.100 --> 00:44:08.390
which altogether comes
to 100 million zeni!

00:44:09.850 --> 00:44:11.900
You're kidding!

00:44:12.850 --> 00:44:14.860
That's one stubborn guy!

00:44:29.750 --> 00:44:33.210
What? Kaio-sama said for me to
go to Hell again with Paikuhan,

00:44:33.290 --> 00:44:36.800
and put down Broly,
who is running amuck?

00:44:42.180 --> 00:44:45.050
There's just no helping
that Broly, huh?

00:44:47.850 --> 00:44:51.020
All right, but before I do, I guess
I can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:44:51.100 --> 00:44:53.730
Let me eat first, okay?

00:44:59.780 --> 00:45:02.740
<i>D! R! A! G! O! N! Dragon Power!</i>

00:45:03.030 --> 00:45:06.280
<i>D! R! A! G! O! N! Dragon Power!</i>

00:45:06.370 --> 00:45:09.830
<i>Power! Power! Power!</i>

00:45:09.910 --> 00:45:15.330
<i>Dragon Power!</i>

00:45:24.010 --> 00:45:30.270
<i>From faraway in the
darkness, they come...</i>

00:45:30.350 --> 00:45:35.940
<i>Biowarriors, with their
genetics rearranged.</i>

00:45:36.020 --> 00:45:42.280
<i>Against</i> a <i>guy that cannot
be defeated alone,</i>

00:45:42.360 --> 00:45:47.950
<i>if our two hearts meld into one,</i>

00:45:48.030 --> 00:45:54.160
<i>Victory will smile on us!</i>

00:45:54.250 --> 00:45:55.830
<i>D! Doesn't matter how long,</i>

00:45:55.920 --> 00:45:57.380
<i>R! Remain moving forward,</i>

00:45:57.460 --> 00:46:00.800
<i>A! Affirming endless love!</i>

00:46:00.880 --> 00:46:03.920
<i>GO! Fight! Go! Go! Go!</i>

00:46:04.010 --> 00:46:06.800
<i>N! No need to hold back!</i>

00:46:06.890 --> 00:46:13.560
<i>The future for the two
of us is unlimited!</i>

00:46:13.640 --> 00:46:16.600
<i>D! R! A! G! O! N! Dragon Power!</i>

00:46:16.900 --> 00:46:19.940
<i>D! R! A! G! O! N! Dragon Power!</i>

00:46:20.020 --> 00:46:23.190
<i>Power! Power! Power!</i>

00:46:23.650 --> 00:46:29.620
<i>Dragon Power!</i>
